   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finance Specialist         Indira Oyugi
Project Lead                 Ambra Scaduti

Project Description :
The objective of the project is: to develop the capacities of FEPES (Association Femmes Porteuses d&apos;Espoir) and
members of two communities in the municipalities of Ngong and Lagdo to adapt to the local context and apply the Gender Action Learning System (GALS), a transformative approach to gender and empowerment that addresses the structural causes of inequality and vulnerability among target groups.</narrative>
  </description>
